==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cats]]. Their high attack speed should overwhelm the Mooths and Metal Hippoes.

